  "designNote": "The approved default idle frame 3 is the foreground protagonist at 8× integer scale. The irregular reference mark opens behind it, remaining mostly visible while the protagonist provides a deliberate occlusion. A smaller wizard stays elevated at the right. The four held-prop crabs make a gentle staggered formation rather than an index grid. Project-name typography is subordinate to the protagonist. Both themes share exact geometry and unchanged sprite colours; no new illustrated scene, prop or IP element. The mark alone uses 55% original RGB and 45% theme-paper RGB for separation at the deliberate overlap. Its original alpha and irregular silhouette are unchanged. This is a deterministic compositing derivative, not a new source drawing. All character and prop colours stay exact."
